elementor-size-default\">MEDICINES AT SIDDHA 365<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-34c8d5c elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"34c8d5c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"201\" data-end=\"526\">The Siddha System of Medicine originated in the <strong data-start=\"249\" data-end=\"273\">pre-Ayurvedic period<\/strong>, dating back nearly <strong data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"310\">10,000 years<\/strong>, alongside the civilizations of <strong data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"371\">Mohenjo-daro and Harappa<\/strong> in the Indus River Valley. It is a profound contribution of the <strong data-start=\"436\" data-end=\"465\">ancient Dravidian culture<\/strong>, recognized as one of the oldest civilizations in the world.<\/p><p data-start=\"528\" data-end=\"886\">Rooted deeply in the wisdom of <strong data-start=\"559\" data-end=\"589\">ancient Tamil civilization<\/strong>, Siddha medicine emphasizes not only physical healing but also <strong data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"714\">moral principles, ethical living, and holistic well-being<\/strong>. These guiding values make the Siddha system exceptionally relevant to today\u2019s modern healthcare needs, where balanced mental, physical, and emotional health is essential.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-65ef1e0 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"65ef1e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInLeft&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrappe